MIT License

This module's wrapper code is forked from @loloof64/react-native-stockfish
(MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 loloof64) with the engine replaced. It contains:

- Wrapper/bridge code: MIT (this repository's root LICENSE.md applies to
  first-party modifications; original wrapper Copyright (c) 2024 loloof64).
- cpp/line_queue.{h,cpp}: first-party, MIT. Written 2026-08-18 to replace
  cpp/stream_fix.{h,cpp}, which carried no copyright line and no licence text —
  only a comment reading "Taken from jusax23/flutter_stockfish_plugin". That
  project is GPL-3.0; the intermediate fork this module was taken from
  (@loloof64/react-native-stockfish) is MIT, which is where the earlier "MIT"
  description here came from. Whether those files were GPL-3.0 code relicensed
  upstream, or an independent MIT implementation, could not be determined from
  the files themselves. They were replaced rather than relicensed so the
  question does not arise; the replacement was written from scratch against the
  interface this module uses and carries nothing over. The originals are
  deleted.
- cpp/arasan/: the Arasan chess engine, Copyright 1994-2026 by Jon Dart,
  distributed under its MIT-style license — see cpp/arasan/LICENSE.
  Vendored at the commit recorded in cpp/arasan/VENDORED.txt, with one patch:
  arasanx.cpp main() renamed to arasan_core (marked "PATCHED" inline).
- assets/arasanv8-*.nnue: the Arasan neural network, from the arasan-chess
  repository's network/ directory, covered by the same Arasan license.

